## Ignore all directories and their contents
##*/
#
## Ignore all files with no extension
#*.*
#
## But don't ignore these specific files
#!.clang-*
#!.cmake-format.py
#!.dockerignore
#!.hadolint.yaml
#!.license.tmpl
#!.yamllint
#!pyproject.toml
#
## Include specific file types regardless of location
#!**.patch
#!**.ps1
#!**.py
#!**.sh
#
## Include specific directories and their contents
#!*/conan/**
#!*/scripts/**
#
## Exclude certain directories
#.git/
#.idea/
#.venv/
#.vscode/
#build*/
